{"id":"c27f87e6422a971f","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-hanai.md","title":"Hanai–Morita–Stone Metrization Theorem","display":"thm-hanai — Hanai–Morita–Stone Metrization Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hanai","aliases":["58-thm-hanai"],"display":"thm-hanai — Hanai–Morita–Stone Metrization Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hanai"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hanai</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hanai — Hanai–Morita–Stone Metrization Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f22350be65138e0e\" href=\"?note=f22350be65138e0e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,d_X,d_Y\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,d_X,d_Y\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\)</span> (metric predicate) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau;X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau;X,d)\\)</span> (metric-induced topology predicate defined here).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\)</span> is the exact continuous closed map with compact fibres.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span> is the Hausdorff predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}topology}\\vdash \\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau;X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}topology}\\vdash \\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau;X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hanai}\\vdash \\exists d_X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau_X;X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\to\\exists d_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau_Y;Y,d_Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hanai}\\vdash \\exists d_X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau_X;X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\to\\exists d_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau_Y;Y,d_Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, every perfect Hausdorff image of a metrizable space is metrizable.</li>\n<li>The induced topology is expanded locally, eliminating the unsourced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Induces}\">\\(\\operatorname{Induces}\\)</span> symbol.</li>\n<li>The former ordinal-exponentiation formula was unrelated to Hanai's theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f22350be65138e0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top4-perfect-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space","status":"resolved","id":"69f8a4b0afb36176","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,d_X,d_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau;X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metric\\text{-}topology}\\vdash \\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau;X,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d,X)\\land\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hanai}\\vdash \\exists d_X\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau_X;X,d_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop4PerfectMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\to\\exists d_Y\\in V\\;\\mathrm{MetricTopology}_S(\\tau_Y;Y,d_Y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Induces}","display":false}],"bytes":1538,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-hanai.md|58-thm-hanai]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["267957a097ff75bf","f22350be65138e0e","69f8a4b0afb36176"]}